      "title": "Google Cloud Adds Self-Managed VMware Cloud Foundation on Bare Metal",
      "summary": "Google Cloud has made a self-managed VMware solution generally available, running VMware Cloud Foundation 9.x on dedicated Z3 bare metal with root access across ESXi, vCenter and NSX in 22 regions. It...",
